<h3>Skills</h3>
<p>Machine learning: supervised learning, feature engineering, model evaluation and cross-validation, time-series forecasting; scikit-learn, PyTorch, TensorFlow/Keras.</p>
<p>Deep learning: neural networks for computer vision, sequence modelling, and generative modelling.</p>
<p>Statistics &amp; simulation: probability and statistical inference, exploratory data analysis, uncertainty quantification, nonlinear optimisation, techno-economic and longitudinal modelling.</p>
<p>LLMs &amp; agents: LLM APIs and integration, structured extraction from documents, agentic workflows, evaluation.</p>
<p>Data &amp; MLOps: Python (NumPy, Pandas), SQL; Matplotlib; Git, CI/CD; Docker, AWS.</p>

